  "Engine metrics and query events carry `oneuptime.database.server.id` = `4f7f2c9e-0000-4000-8000-000000000001`. The [Recommendations](/dashboard/1/database-servers/2/recommendations) tab offers ready-made Valkey monitors, each scoped to this database, once the metrics they read (from the collector's receiver for this engine) have arrived — among them one that fires when they stop. To build your own, create a **Metrics** monitor over an engine metric and filter it on that attribute (or group it by the attribute to cover several databases with one monitor — each series then lands on its own database): its alerts and incidents then appear on this database's Alerts and Incidents tabs, and none are opened for this database while it is in a scheduled maintenance window. A chart opened from this database's **Metrics** tab has **Create monitor**, which fills that filter in for you (a metric the chart adds up across series becomes a monitor that alerts on each series). Threshold a gauge (connections, memory, replication lag) or a ratio of two gauges. A cumulative counter (deadlocks, slow queries, evictions) only ever grows and monitors have no rate, so turn it into per-interval deltas with the collector's `cumulativetodelta` processor before alerting on it.":
    "引擎指标和查询事件带有 `oneuptime.database.server.id` = `4f7f2c9e-0000-4000-8000-000000000001`。一旦监视器读取的指标（来自收集器针对此引擎的接收器）到达，[建议](/dashboard/1/database-servers/2/recommendations)选项卡就会提供现成的 Valkey 监视器，每个都限定在此数据库——其中包括一个在指标停止时触发的监视器。如需自行创建，请针对某个引擎指标创建一个 **指标** 监视器，并按该属性筛选（或按该属性分组，用一个监视器覆盖多个数据库——每个序列随后会落到各自的数据库上）：它的警报和事件随后会显示在此数据库的警报和事件选项卡上，而此数据库处于计划维护窗口期间不会为它打开任何警报或事件。从此数据库的 **指标** 选项卡打开的图表带有 **创建监视器**，它会为您填好该筛选条件（图表跨序列求和的指标会变成一个按每个序列发出警报的监视器）。请为仪表值（连接、内存、复制延迟）或两个仪表值之比设置阈值。累计计数器（死锁、慢查询、驱逐）只会增长，而监视器没有速率，因此在对它发出警报之前，请用收集器的 `cumulativetodelta` 处理器把它转换为每个间隔的增量。",
